{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486220/extras/0842994492ccaa60d8e77dea09aad6c9.avif?t=1758973001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486220/extras_big/0842994492ccaa60d8e77dea09aad6c9.avif?t=1758973001 width=800 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cats Together</strong> is a <i>platform puzzle co-op game</i> about a cat duo who have moved into an abandoned house and now wander around the neighbourhood, searching for mysterious packages sent to their new home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By embarking on an adventure, they will make new friends and get to know the valley they live in now better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486220/extras/d95a5f066269a109309773dc3dbb3410.avif?t=1758973001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486220/extras_big/d95a5f066269a109309773dc3dbb3410.avif?t=1758973001 width=800 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just like cats in real life, you can:</strong> walk around, sneak into hard-to-reach places, chase the birds with their teasing looks, bond with your mates. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486220/extras/42ea7844f3da50c3f94a2b39947c5e56.poster.avif?t=1758973001\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486220/extras/42ea7844f3da50c3f94a2b39947c5e56.webm?t=1758973001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486220/extras/42ea7844f3da50c3f94a2b39947c5e56.mp4?t=1758973001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to reach great heights, just use your cat buddy to stand on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486220/extras/e52f09bfe55421ab1d29c8e3793423a8.avif?t=1758973001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486220/extras_big/e52f09bfe55421ab1d29c8e3793423a8.avif?t=1758973001 width=800 height=222 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memories for Two:</strong> Grab your friends and family members to join you on this local cooperative journey through the fields.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wonderful Guide:</strong>\u00a0Zack the Beaver\u00a0is a long-time resident of the valley, so he\u2019ll be happy to accompany you throughout your adventure and help you out in moments of need.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amicable Creatures:</strong> During your adventure you\u2019ll meet many unique characters. Help them out and become friends with them to receive special gifts!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of Tasks: </strong>Seemingly endless meadows quickly morph into a wide arrangement of diverse locations that you\u2019ll pass on your journey. There are <i><strong>four extra levels</strong></i> with special mechanics that will tell more stories about the game\u2019s world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feels Like Home:</strong> The serenity of nature and the brightness of the colors add a calm and colorful atmosphere allowing players to relax completely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486220/extras/073e2ac02a34a61fae405de4b9bade70.avif?t=1758973001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486220/extras_big/073e2ac02a34a61fae405de4b9bade70.avif?t=1758973001 width=800 height=118 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make sure to follow us on any of our socials to keep up with the latest updates of the game! We are super happy to stay in touch :) Be nice, have fun!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486220/extras/47ec2e18488d9e927ccbc297c7929c45.poster.avif?t=1758973001\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486220/extras/47ec2e18488d9e927ccbc297c7929c45.webm?t=1758973001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486220/extras/47ec2e18488d9e927ccbc297c7929c45.mp4?t=1758973001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Key to Happiness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486220/03f36a9e2d3f09c16ffdfb12bcec19ad22ffa44b.jpg"},{"name":"First Box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486220/39feef382436ccb523d643db97f9c5f49095a790.jpg"},{"name":"Fishing Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486220/95167c2bc3680c0a82e38e6b5989703d78c38c49.jpg"},{"name":". \u0741\u208a \u22b9 . \u0741 \u27e1 \u0741 . \u22b9 \u208a \u0741.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486220/e8285bf4edb5369930b06b20b4d46f208ea90a38.jpg"},{"name":"Beautiful Bouquet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486220/8e29396ebd9003b89c2a59cc1535b6a98948d2e7.jpg"},{"name":"Fly Hi